Four frames of us

841
00:59:55,052 --> 00:59:59,822
Years from now when we're far apart

842
00:59:59,872 --> 01:00:04,922
I'll pull it out and it'll pull my heart

843
01:00:04,972 --> 01:00:07,162
Back to the booth, back to the blue

844
01:00:07,212 --> 01:00:14,202
Back to the day I laughed with you

845
01:00:14,252 --> 01:00:16,662
Four frames, four little worlds

846
01:00:16,712 --> 01:00:19,002
Crooked smiles and windblown curls

847
01:00:19,052 --> 01:00:21,122
One's too blurry, one's too bright

848
01:00:21,172 --> 01:00:23,922
But every single one is right

849
01:00:23,972 --> 01:00:26,422
Four frames, tucked in my case

850
01:00:26,472 --> 01:00:28,762
Carry you all to every place

851
01:00:28,812 --> 01:00:31,262
Click, click, flash, flash

852
01:00:31,312 --> 01:00:35,232
Four frames of us

853
01:00:41,772 --> 01:00:50,052
Click, click

854
01:00:51,072 --> 01:00:54,394
Four frames of us

